Most Common Cause (Minikube)

Earlier you built the image using:

Shell
docker build -t sre-copilot .

But Kubernetes is looking inside the Minikube Docker environment, not your normal Docker environment.

Fix #1 (Recommended)

Connect terminal to Minikube Docker:

Shell
eval $(minikube docker-env)

Verify:

Shell
docker images

If you do NOT see:

Plain Text
sre-copilot
 

build it again:

Shell
docker build -t sre-copilot:latest .

Verify:

Shell
docker images | grep sre-copilot

Expected:

Plain Text
